# Celiums Memory — Code owners
# Implements ADR-018 §"Required hardening — Required reviewers".
#
# Rules:
# - Every path needs at least one owner.
# - Security-sensitive paths require 2 maintainer approvals (enforced
#   via branch protection rules at the GitHub-org level).
# - Governance docs require BDFL sign-off.

# ── Default owner ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                       @terrizoaguimor

# ── Security-sensitive paths (2 reviews required) ─────────────────
/apps/cloudflare-worker/src/                 @terrizoaguimor
/rust/crates/celiums-memory-cli/src/server.rs @terrizoaguimor
/rust/crates/celiums-memory-engine/src/      @terrizoaguimor

# ── Supply chain ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/workflows/                     @terrizoaguimor
/.github/dependabot.yml                 @terrizoaguimor
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @terrizoaguimor
/apps/cloudflare-worker/Dockerfile      @terrizoaguimor
/dependencies-rationale.md              @terrizoaguimor
/SECURITY.md                            @terrizoaguimor

# ── Governance + ADRs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/adr/                              @terrizoaguimor
/GOVERNANCE.md                          @terrizoaguimor
/MAINTAINERS.md                         @terrizoaguimor
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                     @terrizoaguimor
/LICENSE                                @terrizoaguimor
/NOTICE                                 @terrizoaguimor

# ── Runbooks (ops review) ─────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/ops/runbooks/                     @terrizoaguimor
